<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunday's spot rupee rates in kerb market supplied by Khanani &amp; Kalia International:</p>
<p>			     Buying rate	   Selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	  40.25		   40.30</p>
<p>    Pound sterling     62.35		   62.45</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	26.30		   26.35</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	  0.366		   0.368</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	  10.68		   10.70</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	   10.92		   10.94</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	  1.07		    1.09</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		8.80 pct		9.00 pct</p>
</text>
